      "translatedText": "| Concept | Description |\n|---|---|\n| IP Address | Used to locate devices in the network |\n| Port Number | Used to distinguish different programs |\n| Datagram | UDP datagram; one send corresponds to one datagram |\n| Broadcast | Send data to multiple devices within a local area network |\n| Multicast | Send data to devices that have joined the same multicast group |\n| Packet Loss | UDP does not guarantee that data will be delivered |\n| Out\\-of\\-Order | UDP does not guarantee that data will arrive in order |",
